          "whatsNew": {
            "en-US": "A payment already in your list can now be told it was a move between your own accounts. Open it and tap \"This was a move\", then say where the money went — the amount and the account are taken from the row you are looking at, so there is nothing to retype.\n\nThis matters for anything already filed wrongly. Until now a move could only be started from the add sheet, which is not where you are standing when you notice the mistake. Stating it does not add a second entry: the row you opened is relabell"
          }
        },
